2796a6452c640b746948df228/control-medium-anatomy%402x.png","line":19,"embedded":true},{"title":"A partial screenshot of Control Center on iPhone, highlighting that the Silent mode control is active, with a symbol of a bell with a line drawn through it and red tint.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/01a84972ab485b0b33d4342bd1b1a42a/control-control-center%402x.png","line":32,"embedded":true},{"title":"A partial screenshot of the bottom of the Lock Screen on iPhone, highlighting that the Silent mode control is active on the right, with a symbol of a bell with a line drawn through it and red tint.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/912ae3e318cf61d7146965079dc682cb/control-lock-screen%402x.png","line":36,"embedded":true},{"title":"A partial screenshot that displays the Dynamic Island at the top of the Home Screen on iPhone, showing that the Silent mode control is active with a red tinted symbol of a bell with a line drawn through it in the leading area and red tinted text that says Silent in the trailing area.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/e336ce21634c50e782cfab47988eb576/control-dynamic-island%402x.png","line":40,"embedded":true},{"title":"Best practices","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/controls#Best-practices","line":45},{"title":"Live Activities","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/live-activities","line":47},{"title":"SF Symbols","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/sf-symbols","line":51},{"title":"Symbols","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Symbols","line":53},{"title":"`SymbolEffect`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Symbols/SymbolEffect","line":53},{"title":"Branding","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/branding","line":55},{"title":"An inactive control toggle with a light bulb symbol that isn't tinted.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/858a6c878e81223350b2c6175e7edc8d/control-lightbulb-not-tinted%402x.png","line":57,"embedded":true},{"title":"An active control toggle with a light bulb symbol that's tinted yellow.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/6beab4a3187d3a10493645eaf5447811/control-lightbulb-tinted%402x.png","line":59,"embedded":true},{"title":"`promptsForUserConfiguration()`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SwiftUI/ControlWidgetConfiguration/promptsForUserConfiguration\\(\\","line":61},{"title":"A representation of a control with the ability to set an option to a value a person chooses.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/2862099d2344c5c6576a3c4503b0c0b4/control-configuration-options%402x.png","line":63,"embedded":true},{"title":"`controlWidgetActionHint(_:)`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SwiftUI/View/controlWidgetActionHint\\(_:\\","line":65},{"title":"A partial screenshot of the Home Screen on iPhone that displays hint text for the Action button. The hint text is Hold for Silent.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/530aa049e2d419ed4af0e3e4a0fb812e/controls-action-button-coaching-text-on%402x.png","line":67,"embedded":true},{"title":"A partial screenshot of the Home Screen on iPhone that displays hint text for the Action button. The hint text is Hold for Ring.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/8058fe453e9c21c3654f7917f533a70a/controls-action-button-coaching-text-off%402x.png","line":69,"embedded":true},{"title":"A medium-size control toggle displaying a symbol of a light bulb, a title, and value text.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/3239b45e3faff12f7e0c8faad57ac4da/control-regular-text%402x.png","line":75,"embedded":true},{"title":"A medium-size control toggle with redacted text.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/60fdc68e4ffd056e2ced9b7c49ed6730/control-redacted-text%402x.png","line":77,"embedded":true},{"title":"`IntentAuthenticationPolicy`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppIntents/IntentAuthenticationPolicy","line":79},{"title":"Camera experiences on a locked device","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/controls#Camera-experiences-on-a-locked-device","line":81},{"title":"LockedCameraCapture","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/LockedCameraCapture","line":83},{"title":"Platform considerations","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/controls#Platform-considerations","line":89},{"title":"Resources","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/controls#Resources","line":93},{"title":"Related","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/controls#Related","line":95},{"title":"Widgets","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/widgets","line":97},{"title":"Action button","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/action-button","line":99},{"title":"Developer documentation","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/controls#Developer-documentation","line":101},{"title":"LockedCameraCapture","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/LockedCameraCapture","line":103},{"title":"WidgetKit","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/WidgetKit","line":105},{"title":"Change log","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/controls#Change-log","line":107}],"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ai stuff/antigravity-awesome-skills-main/plugins/antigravity-awesome-skills-claude/skills/hig-components-controls/references/controls.md"},
